{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a world where people<strong>\u00a0</strong>rip letters out of their names and use them as weapons, shields, and tools. Each letter has a different function. With 26 possible abilities, there are practically endless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which name will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo will take you through the first chapter of an adventure, and it includes one town, one dungeon, and lots of secrets to find. Try playing through this chapter with different names to see what changes. Some paths may close, and others open, but there will always be a way forward.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841490?t=1752622687","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841490?t=1752622687","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841490/f50de8c037044e042d1bead8e0ea5d3763348af8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752622687","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841490/f50de8c037044e042d1bead8e0ea5d3763348af8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752622687","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a world where people<strong>\u00a0</strong>rip letters out of their names and use them as weapons, shields, and tools. Each letter has a different function. With 26 possible abilities, there are practically endless combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Which name will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo will ta